        "modulo": null,
        "html": "<!--\n    Componente: Card de Episódio (Cyber Emerald)\n    Marcadores: #numero#, #titulo#, #descricao#, #url#, #duracao#, #status-classe#, #status-texto#\n    Estados suportados: disponível (emerald) e em breve (amber, com ícone de relógio e link desabilitado).\n-->\n<article class=\"c2f-card group relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white\/5 bg-[#0a1510]\/80 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-emerald-500\/40 hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_-20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.45)]\">\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\/10 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\">\n        <span class=\"font-mono text-4xl font-black leading-none text-emerald-500\/30 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-emerald-400\/60\">#numero#<\/span>\n        <span class=\"#status-classe#\">#status-texto#<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-extrabold leading-snug text-white\">#titulo#<\/h3>\n    <p class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400\">#descricao#<\/p>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white\/5 pt-4\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"\/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"\/><\/svg>#duracao#\n        <\/span>\n        <a href=\"#url#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-extrabold text-emerald-300 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:gap-2.5 hover:text-emerald-200\">\n            Assistir<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"\/><\/svg>\n        <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n<\/article>\n",
