        "html": "<!--\n    Componente: Botões CTA (par primário + secundário)\n    Marcadores: #url-primario#, #texto-primario#, #url-secundario#, #texto-secundario#\n    O primário usa c2f-btn-glow (varredura luminosa definida no CSS do Layout Principal).\n-->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center\">\n    <a href=\"#url-primario#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"c2f-btn-glow group inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-extrabold text-[#060e0a] shadow-[0_0_32px_-6px_rgba(52,211,153,0.7)] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-emerald-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_44px_-4px_rgba(52,211,153,0.9)] sm:w-auto\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-125\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"\/><\/svg>\n        #texto-primario#\n    <\/a>\n    <a href=\"#url-secundario#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"group inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-emerald-500\/30 bg-white\/5 px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-100 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-emerald-400\/60 hover:bg-emerald-500\/10 hover:text-white sm:w-auto\">\n        #texto-secundario#\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"\/><\/svg>\n    <\/a>\n<\/div>\n",
